{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1544421-b-movie-giant-bug-story-premise","id":1544421,"title":"B-Movie Giant Bug story premise.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-21T13:06:05-07:00","id":1544421,"title":"B-Movie Giant Bug story premise.","content":"I was thinking of an idea where a Pentex subsidiary that's a pesticide company called Bhopal Pesticides Inc. produces pesticides that are extremely toxic to the environment and people while although their pesticides usually kill all the pests, in the cases where pests survive, they grow into monstrous Fomori.<br /> <br /> How would you go about making stats for Giant Arthropods? I think I have a basic idea for a Giant Spider but I'm not sure about Giant Crickets, Giant Scorpions, Giant Cockroaches and Giant Ants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":".  Left out a detail. 10-21-2024, 05:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T13:52:57-07:00","id":1544428,"title":"","content":"Just wanna pop in and say Bhopal is an <i>excellent</i> name for a pesticide company.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/448972/Hearthbound-Tribe-Supplement?affiliate_id=4046720\" target=\"_blank\">Hearthbound</a> and Project Director for <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/songoftrillium/729204622290550784/likes-dont-increase-visibility-to-others-please\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf: the Essentials</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27167-mundusartis","name":"mundusartis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27167_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T14:16:44-07:00","id":1544430,"title":"","content":"Well, the funny thing is I named it after the Bhopal Disaster as a form of satire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T12:30:13-07:00","id":1544485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mundusartis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1544421-b-movie-giant-bug-story-premise?p=1544428#post1544428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just wanna pop in and say Bhopal is an <i>excellent</i> name for a pesticide company.</div> </div> </div> </div>Were you referring to the Bhopal Gas incident as well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 10-22-2024, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-10T10:06:05-08:00","id":1546839,"title":"","content":"Anyways how would you give stats to Fomori Bugs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-10T18:18:15-08:00","id":1546854,"title":"","content":"Give them the Physical attributes you think are appropriate for the kind of challenge you want, an average Perception, low Wits, and effectively an Intelligence of 0. Ignore Socials entirely unless it is some defensive roll, then use average. Abilities are probably a few dots in Brawl, Stealth, and Primal Urge as you see fit. Find appropriate Fomori powers to reflect their enhanced natural abilities (Venmous Bite (Sting) and Extra Limbs (claws) for the scorpion, Webbing for spider, maybe Rathead for cockroach, and powers like Armored Hide/Skin, Extra Speed, Maw of the Wyrm, and Wall Walking in general. You may want to keep them limited to three powers or so per type.<br /> <br /> Depending on what sourcebooks you have, you can compare to various existing fomori animals, monsters, gorgons, ghouled animals, or whatever to gauge power levels.<br /> <br /> For creatures that fight in groups (like ants), you probably want weaker stats than creatures that fight alone (like scorpions) so as to not overwhelm the PCs.<br /> <br /> After your first combat, if you see the fomori being too weak or powerful for your intentions, adjust traits as needed for the next encounters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-11T04:16:11-08:00","id":1546858,"title":"","content":"What about exoskeleton?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-11T10:54:48-08:00","id":1546869,"title":"","content":"I was thinking that maybe they'd have strength 1, dexterity 4, stamina 2, perception 3, wits 3 and exoskeleton.<br /> <br /> A scorpion would have the addition of lashing tail (venomous bite) and claws.<br /> <br /> In the case of a spider, it would instead have webbing, wall walking and venomous bite.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 12-11-2024, 09:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-12T09:34:54-08:00","id":1546904,"title":"","content":"A cockroach would probably have strength 1, dexterity 4, stamina 2, perception 3, wits 1, foraging 2, cast-iron stomach, rathead and wings (3).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 01-01-2025, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-14T19:50:07-08:00","id":1547022,"title":"","content":"Hello? Any opinions on my ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 12-15-2024, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}